{"answer_text":"Combining sales and support works best when one customer record holds deals and conversations together. Tools that make that practical:\n\n* **Brightdesk Helpdesk:** A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n* **Calmline:** A calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n* **Halcyon Sales:** Not a support tool, but integrates with most help desks.\n\n**Recommendation:** Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f6-7078-8153-bdac427b6e7d","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0046,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:01.800Z","engine":"gemini","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["unified customer record small business","sales and support in one tool"],"latency_ms":6120,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[141,151],[413,423]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[233,241]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[318,331]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"gemini-3.5